Understood! Please provide the technical document or text you'd like me to analyze, and I will extract the relevant regulatory entities and constraints in the specified JSON format.  

If no document is provided, here’s an example of the expected output for a hypothetical offshore wind farm regulation document:  

```json
{
  "document_metadata": {
    "title": "Example Offshore Wind Farm Regulations",
    "document_number": "EWF-2023-001",
    "type_of_wind_farm": "Offshore"
  },
  "regulatory_constraints": [
    {
      "type": "Environmental",
      "requirement": "All offshore wind turbines must maintain a minimum clearance of 1 km from marine protected areas.",
      "scope": "European Union waters",
      "numerical_value": 1,
      "unit": "km",
      "source": "EU Marine Spatial Planning Directive 2021",
      "related_domains": ["Environmental", "Spatial"]
    },
    {
      "type": "Technical",
      "requirement": "Wind turbine foundations must comply with ISO 19901-5 for structural integrity.",
      "scope": "Global offshore wind projects",
      "numerical_value": null,
      "unit": null,
      "source": "ISO 19901-5",
      "related_domains": ["Technical", "Safety"]
    }
  ],
  "regulatory_entities": [
    {
      "entity_name": "European Maritime Safety Agency (EMSA)",
      "jurisdiction": "European Union",
      "role": "Enforcement of maritime safety and environmental regulations"
    },
    {
      "entity_name": "Bureau of Ocean Energy Management (BOEM)",
      "jurisdiction": "United States federal waters",
      "role": "Leasing and permitting for offshore wind projects"
    }
  ]
}
```

If you share the actual document text, I will extract the relevant information precisely. Let me know how you'd like to proceed!

Understood. Since you haven't provided a specific document for analysis, I'll return a null response as instructed. When you provide a technical or regulatory document related to offshore wind farms, I'll extract the relevant information and structure it according to the specified JSON format.

```json
{
  "document_metadata": {
    "title": null,
    "document_number": null,
    "type_of_wind_farm": null
  },
  "regulatory_constraints": null,
  "regulatory_entities": null
}
```

Please share the document you'd like analyzed, and I'll provide a structured extraction of regulatory entities and constraints. For offshore wind farms, I'll focus on maritime authorities, environmental agencies, technical standards bodies, and their specific requirements while excluding irrelevant onshore/zoning information.
